# Saving and rollback
@scenario tutorial_lesson_19
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: If you save here, what should I remember when you come back? Let's give the scene something worth keeping.
ginger: Save at the next question. Answer it, reload, and try the other choice.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: Where should a story choice be stored?
> In VN state so save and rollback can restore it. -> correct
> Only in the displayed dialogue text. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: A replay can reconstruct the story from its saved state. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: A replay can reconstruct the story from its saved state.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_19]
[flag tutorial_done_19]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_5]
